# Go to any heading of the agenda files
Output docs/media/goto-agenda.gif
Source docs/media/tapes/common.tape

Hide
Type "export ORG_DEMO_DIR=/tmp/org-demo-goto-agenda; clear; DEMO_SNACKS=1 nvim -u docs/media/demo/init.lua $ORG_DEMO_DIR/notes.org" Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Show
Sleep 1s
Hide
Ctrl+G
Type@5ms `Cap <leader>og go to any heading of the agenda files` Enter
Show
Type " og"
Sleep 1.8s
Type "passport"
Sleep 1.2s
Enter
Sleep 1.8s
Hide
Ctrl+G
Type@5ms `Cap <leader>og again: another file` Enter
Show
Type " og"
Sleep 1.5s
Type "review pull"
Sleep 1.2s
Enter
Sleep 1.8s
Sleep 1.5s
